Subject: [PATCH] reconcile protocol-owned dynamic interfaces with parent updates

DHCP transition options describe a desired set, not append-only interfaces.
Let protocol notifications replace only their exact parent's children, fence
old callbacks across setups, and retire children on parent loss or teardown.
Keep legacy add_dynamic callers compatible and protect static/foreign names.

